{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-04_end","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-04","title":"并肩之约-2","storyCode":"7-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-04_end.txt","sourceHash":"142163baea2ee32f78f4aa008f5ba83583c79a0923c5bbc462f4fc7bab02d2f1","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"6:00am"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"消灭侦查部队后，不会剩多少时间。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"正如你所说。时间紧迫。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"干员不会站在沙地上扒城上去。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......有些时候我们是会这么做啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是核心城正在移动中，要想进入下层基础结构，确实不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果干员站在沙地上等着移动城邦驶过，无论是相对速度还是相对高度，都限制了干员的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"没办法打开移动城邦底部的维修窗口与废料出口的话，准备好的诱饵与隐蔽会失去意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我们的五支小队会通过载具，以沙尘作为掩护接近核心城，最后利用工具登上核心城的底层工业结构。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"罗德岛居然只派遣了五支小队？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有急着想让乌萨斯的地方将领捏到我们把柄的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"更不希望他们派出一艘高速军舰，在荒原上摧毁我们的船舰，杀死我们的雇员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使事情这么发生了，你也不会在任何一张报纸上看见证据。银行家和保险业只会划去你的名字，将所有的积累全部放进自己的保险库。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"没有人会开口，因为乌萨斯不会希望有人开口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"中立身份意味着我们在夹缝中依然拥有些许的自由，相应的，罗德岛不能拥有任何政治势力作为后盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"隐蔽行事是我们的生存理念。派遣小队去救你时，也是一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"五支小队。留下痕迹、清除痕迹；目标完成、目标失败。无论如何，罗德岛最多只能派出五支小队。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但更多小队意味着更多的武装力量！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"即使没办法解决问题？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是龙门这样的城邦，想要消灭我们也是易如反掌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你也看见了，成建制的近卫局和比起各国顶级精英武装也毫不逊色的特殊部队，他们的实力远不是一家医药公司能比的。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那为什么我们要参与？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"因为这个阴谋已经卷入了感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，罗德岛已经离开了龙门，以每小时十五公里的速度驶向下一个贸易城邦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在这之前，我们可能会在荒野上停留数个星期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"除了靠近我们的罗德岛通讯专员和可信任船只，没有人会收到我们的信号，我们会在各城邦的移动规划中，挑选出避开所有人的路线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使龙门在事件过后反悔，他们也没法再找到我们。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但这样还不够吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这一拳打上去不够狠！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"还要更锋利。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们的赌注应该不会只有这点。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。我们还需要额外的致命砝码。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士和凯尔希，都变得很阴沉可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我知道事情的必要性，你们也不用......露出那种笑容吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......我笑了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道凯尔希医生笑了啦。虽然你嘴唇不动，但我是能感受到笑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......真好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不，事先声明，我没有要和这个人修缮人际关系的意思。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"呵，我也没这个意思。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"有无必要取决于双方的自由意愿。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这五支小队，将分别由我、阿米娅与另外三位精英干员带领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"三支作战小队，一支侦察小队，以及一支特殊作业小队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"其中，有一支作战小队的队长，你也许该先见她一面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香！等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......煌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你伤得好重，怎么还跑出来？快回去。快点回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你这次要出战？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我找人替你。让Misery去。他比你擅长攻坚战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"他一挥手就能解决的事，让他去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想我去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"对，你不该去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"煌让人感觉很奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"这和你以前的任务可不一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"因为可能会死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"说啥啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么能，怎么......是怎么这么轻松地说出来啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你年纪太小了，这么危险的任务，你是不该去的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"可阿米娅也要去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"因为她......！她是......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"她是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"她和我一样，是感染者，也是干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我检查了日志。Ace和Scout都在切尔诺伯格，他们没回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，他们已经不在了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去看看。我要明白是怎么回事。我要看看管整合运动的人，我要知道是谁做了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我要知道在Ace和Scout身上发生了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香？这种事你......你可以不记的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......煌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"(粗口)，我他妈在说什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不，对不起，我不该这么说。我不应该。**，我这张臭嘴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，他们的死......他们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"煌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"错的是我。开心是记忆，伤心也是记忆。我的错。你不能不记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"煌变得很奇怪。说的话也支离破碎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不想你那么痛苦。为什么非要去回头看它？如果是你的话......是可以把记忆放走的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以把它就放在那里。让它就躺在那里，不要回头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不看......记忆又能用来做什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不看的话......就是忘记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会去忘掉的。我绝对不会忘记任何一个人的死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哈。对。你和我一样。你也是罗德岛的精英干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不能代你去，真的，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你又流血了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我送你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香......和阿米娅要好好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我会的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"很有必要吗？见她一面......？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛雇佣的精英干员们，都因为种种原因，将自身的精力和专业才能奉献给了罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他们带领的小队会全心全意地支持他们的工作，因为精英干员在某些程度上，可以直接决定一种战术的运用方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但他们并不都......符合我们的想象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"精英干员煌，博士你是见过的。有关煌的很多传闻，可能博士都没听过，实际上，被干员们添油加醋得有些厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在这一位精英干员，所有人对她的印象都不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是博士，应该是能......慢慢地理解她和她的选择的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的反应，也许你已经见过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那......那这样就可以了吗？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"还有什么需要注意的？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大致的安排就是这样。事实上，唔......很现实的，计划是计划，行动是行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"只有行动才是重要的。计划只是行动的雏形，而行动中的意外事件会打破一切计划。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"希望我们没人专做很糟糕的预言。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕.......很糟糕！有些不对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......沙尘的密度还是很稀疏，现在光线的角度，不大行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没在阴影里！如果从舰桥观察下来，我们可能会在开始全力运作前就完全暴露啦！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但已经不能再给机器添加外部遮蔽物了，一旦影响防尘器的空气流通，产生的上升气流，可能不足以保证沙尘浮动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办，要把位置继续后移吗......？可能会赶不及！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......请交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"守林人，请监测实际效果，告诉我接下来要调整的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"骑士？你要......做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"改变光线的角度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是为了减少这片大地上的苦难......我相信，连太阳的光芒，也愿意为我一时颔首。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？沙丘那边是谁？临光吗？她们不登车的还不撤退吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"她在干什么呢，沉思？摆造型......在这摆造型？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，好亮，她整个人开始发光了欸......不，等，糟了！太刺眼了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，谢谢队长......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"如果队长你的手指不是要把我的脑袋捏裂一样扒得那么紧的话，我会很感激你挡住了我的眼睛的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"临光在做什么啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"临光没问题？可......就算队长你这么说，这光也比阳光澈烈太多了，她要干什么啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎么会......周边的光芒好像被临光渐渐同化了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，整个区域内的光，已经慢慢调谐成同一种感觉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道啊，我知道啦。我就是想说，你看，除了耀骑士，有谁能做到这种事呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，看看沙丘影子的投向，你猜现在是下午，还是上午？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我......就是活跃下气氛。而且一会儿开始刮起沙尘，可就看不到影子咯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我这就闭嘴。不好意思。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_aircraft"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"再高些！已经有奇怪颜色的球体划过机身了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"教官，别怕，整合运动的术师没有击毁我们的本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是做诱饵，不是要给整合运动表演飞行技术！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果我们做得很好的话，整合运动的人也会心悦诚服地投降吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那个叫什么，武力展示？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"武力展示又不是叫你表演杂技......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"教官，抓好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"——呕吐袋在哪？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"仪器已经完全启动！阿米娅，车队可以行动了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"各载具驾驶员，保持匀速！依照图示，利用沙尘的掩蔽接近核心城至可使用登城工具的距离！立刻行动！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"沙尘掩盖住了我们载具的踪迹，记得戴好防护用具，别让沙尘进入精密器械！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但......阳光好清澈啊，为什么阳光能穿透沙尘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"核心城底部的可见度似乎增加了，简直是......法术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有......没有这个安排吧？是自然光吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......先别管这么多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！牵引装置，准备发射！各干员，优先确定滑索是否已经完全固定在核心城底部的墙面上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"所有干员都完成转移后，载具会立刻驶走！尽管我很少这么说，但各位干员，我想，现在的阳光，是我们会走好运的兆头！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......一定是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"（一不小心让光芒变得太强烈了，只能往地面倾泻这种事我怎么说得出口......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，核心城似乎在加速？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"即使整个装置借助了风势，也只能保证沙尘的泼洒涵盖到一公里以内的范围！一旦驶出范围，他们必定会发现我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，动作快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"来不及了！我们必须立刻减速！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦驶出扬尘的范围，切尔诺伯格核心城的光学观察装置可能会立刻捕捉到我们，潜入行动会因此失败！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"无论你们还剩几个队员，都快......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"已经不剩下队员了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我自己来！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"（默默戴上防尘面具）","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"请将搭扣给我，我一个人上去。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......太危险了，博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"没有经过干员训练的人独自登城，简直离谱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生居然没有给你安排战场辅助人员吗？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"没有就没有，还能怎么样呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"也许想锻炼我的身体素质才刻意没安排。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"有。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"？！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯尔希一只手环抱过你的腰部，将你拉上了滑索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，下次再自己把握命运吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"风沙很大，那只“手”很坚硬，你有点不确定它是否属于凯尔希。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"各个小队，请各就各位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来的行动，我们不能有任何失误！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder"},{"type":"narration","text":"10:30 a.m.\n核心城地下基建"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，这个痕迹确实也是侵入的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"可以确定入侵者只有一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"前面的血迹，分不清是整合运动的还是谁的，血液还没完全变性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"很可能就是陈警官......！我们必须加快速度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你安全抵达就好。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那也能叫安全......！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......很险。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"托某人的福，我可能差点就见不着你了。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"很，很危险吗？Dr.{@nickname}，有没有受伤？！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"没事，走吧。只是心理创伤而已。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["罗德岛干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["临光"]},{"speakerId":"char_158_milu","aliases":["守林人"]},{"speakerId":"char_401_elysm","aliases":["极境"]}]}
